846
00:38:30.050 --> 00:38:30.650
Hmm.

847
00:38:31.050 --> 00:38:33.030
Wow, that's a really good call.

848
00:38:33.450 --> 00:38:34.050
Yeah.

849
00:38:34.290 --> 00:38:35.930
Here's what I'm thinking, guys.

850
00:38:35.930 --> 00:38:39.230
I'm thinking, maybe she has gone to see his band.

851
00:38:39.470 --> 00:38:41.490
Maybe she went to go see Scrantonicity.

852
00:38:41.810 --> 00:38:44.530
Maybe everyone in the office has gone to see it.

853
00:38:44.650 --> 00:38:48.270
And this is like another request to come see the band.

854
00:38:48.510 --> 00:38:50.530
You know those people, right?

855
00:38:51.050 --> 00:38:53.850
Like, they're in the band, or they do stand-up.

856
00:38:53.970 --> 00:38:54.850
And you're like,

