861
00:39:02.970 --> 00:39:06.930
I think I was this person, because I was always in an improv show.

862
00:39:07.130 --> 00:39:07.590
I was always like,

863
00:39:07.690 --> 00:39:08.890
Hey, catch my improv show.

864
00:39:09.090 --> 00:39:10.030
And people are like,

865
00:39:10.150 --> 00:39:13.450
