00:39:35.270 --> 00:39:35.950
What?

875
00:39:36.250 --> 00:39:36.930
Yeah.

876
00:39:37.090 --> 00:39:37.470
What?

877
00:39:37.890 --> 00:39:38.830
I did.

878
00:39:39.050 --> 00:39:40.650
It was like a...

879
00:39:40.650 --> 00:39:44.270
I was a silent comedic magician.

880
00:39:44.850 --> 00:39:45.210
What?

881
00:39:45.550 --> 00:39:49.410
And I performed to music in comedy clubs.

882
00:39:50.130 --> 00:39:53.090
Jenna, this is so amazing.

883
00:39:53.370 --> 00:39:56.210
I cannot believe I didn't know this about you.

884
00:39:56.350 --> 00:39:58.370
We've been friends for so long.

885
00:39:58.590 --> 00:40:00.950
You were like a comedic mime.

886
00:40:01.870 --> 00:40:02.410
Yeah.

887
00:40:02.570 --> 00:40:02.890
What?

888
00:40:03.210 --> 00:40:06.450
I would give anything to see that.

889
00:40:06.710 --> 00:40:07.170
Anything.

890
00:40:08.210 --> 00:40:12.610
I did magic tricks using my hands.

891
00:40:12.810 --> 00:40:13.330
Oh, God.

892
00:40:13.430 --> 00:40:14.630
And they weren't really magic.

893
00:40:14.630 --> 00:40:15.790
It was a joke.

894
00:40:15.970 --> 00:40:19.070
But I performed it as if I was a great magician.

895
00:40:19.070 --> 00:40:22.930
So, it was like an ironic kind of like...

896
00:40:22.930 --> 00:40:24.670
And you did it to music.

897
00:40:24.890 --> 00:40:25.630
To music.

898
00:40:25.950 --> 00:40:26.950
And did you speak?

899
00:40:27.210 --> 00:40:27.650
No.

900
00:40:27.970 --> 00:40:28.130
No.

901
00:40:28.130 --> 00:40:29.090
There was no speaking.

902
00:40:31.440 --> 00:40:31.860
Yeah.

903
00:40:31.860 --> 00:40:32.860
I need a photo.

904
00:40:32.860 --> 00:40:33.660
I need a video.

905
00:40:33.840 --> 00:40:34.620
I need something.

906
00:40:34.960 --> 00:40:35.460
Okay.

907
00:40:35.540 --> 00:40:37.440
I'll do the show for you sometime.

908
00:40:37.680 --> 00:40:40.640
This was my only foray into...

909
00:40:41.320 --> 00:40:41.820
What?

910
00:40:42.300 --> 00:40:46.420
Promise me we will have wine together and you will do this for me.

911
00:40:46.540 --> 00:40:46.800
Promise me.

912
00:40:46.800 --> 00:40:47.400
I'll do it.

913
00:40:47.400 --> 00:40:49.980
I still have my tuxedo and the music.

914
00:40:50.560 --> 00:40:50.980
Yeah.

915
00:40:51.140 --> 00:40:51.760
I still have it.

916
00:40:51.960 --> 00:40:52.920
You wore a tuxedo.

917
00:40:53.180 --> 00:40:53.740
Yes.

918
00:40:53.740 --> 00:40:55.380
I was a fancy magician.

919
00:40:55.560 --> 00:40:57.200
I wore a coat and tails.

920
00:40:57.660 --> 00:40:58.660
Oh, my God.

921
00:40:59.200 --> 00:40:59.460
Yeah.

922
00:40:59.800 --> 00:41:00.680
So, listen.

923
00:41:01.460 --> 00:41:03.060
My point is...

924
