So, you know, this is why Kevin needs people to come, I think, because, well, he has the

936
00:41:39.860 --> 00:41:40.520
applause meter.

937
00:41:40.740 --> 00:41:41.240
I don't know.

938
00:41:41.500 --> 00:41:44.400
This has gone very off topic, everyone.

939
00:41:44.400 --> 00:41:45.000
I'm sorry.

940
00:41:45.860 --> 00:41:46.460
I...

941
00:41:46.460 --> 00:41:46.820
I...

942
00:41:46.820 --> 00:41:48.740
My heart is so full.

943
00:41:49.260 --> 00:41:50.720
I am...

944
00:41:50.720 --> 00:41:51.620
I am...

945
00:41:51.620 --> 00:41:55.420
This is a gift I was not expecting today.

946
00:41:55.420 --> 00:42:02.980
I have all of these visuals in my head of you in a tuxedo, miming magic tricks at a comedy

947
00:42:02.980 --> 00:42:03.460
