948
00:42:03.860 --> 00:42:04.420
It's...

949
00:42:04.420 --> 00:42:05.460
Yeah.

950
00:42:05.660 --> 00:42:06.720
Oh, it's...

951
00:42:06.720 --> 00:42:09.060
It's just 100% awesome.

952
00:42:09.320 --> 00:42:09.540
Okay.

953
00:42:09.780 --> 00:42:14.060
Well, now, Michael also says he cannot go to Kevin's show.

954
00:42:14.240 --> 00:42:16.880
And Jim and Pam, they're like, oh, light bulb.

