00:42:35.420 --> 00:42:38.880
And also, maybe now it's an opportunity to get away from Jan.

964
00:42:39.620 --> 00:42:40.140
Yeah.

965
00:42:40.560 --> 00:42:44.320
There's a whole deleted scene runner where he's just avoiding having to talk to her.

966
00:42:45.060 --> 00:42:49.960
Well, the reason that Michael can't go to this show or have dinner with Jim and Pam

967
00:42:49.960 --> 00:42:53.960
is because he has taken a second job as a telemarketer.

968
00:42:54.560 --> 00:42:55.980
To pay his bills.

969
00:42:56.660 --> 00:43:00.100
And Paul does this very beautiful thing, I think, in his directing.

