980
00:43:34.060 --> 00:43:34.480
Yeah.

981
00:43:34.720 --> 00:43:37.340
Before we even see what's in the building.

982
00:43:37.340 --> 00:43:39.160
I thought it was so brilliant.

983
00:43:39.860 --> 00:43:39.980
Yeah.

984
00:43:40.380 --> 00:43:40.760
Yeah.

985
00:43:40.920 --> 00:43:42.080
That's some beautiful writing.

