1011
00:44:44.180 --> 00:44:44.980
That's so great.

1012
00:44:45.460 --> 00:44:49.320
Well, I want you guys to know right as they turn down the road to go to Shroot Farms,

1013
00:44:49.360 --> 00:44:53.480
when this scene is happening, there's a great shot of the Shroot Farms mailbox.

